From b26cd4b413c74d77443230a6462d8c24a08a3ffc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 16:33:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 33/39] Captions: show a muted source, keep status, one start
 at launch

- The Captions tab says when the audio source is muted (silence is sent
  then, so no captions appear) instead of looking stuck.
- Choosing the same settings again no longer resets the status to
  "preparing"; nothing restarts, so no new status would arrive.
- OBS sends SCENE_COLLECTION_CHANGED during startup as well; start once,
  at FINISHED_LOADING. Recognizer starts and stops now run one after
  another.
- The audio source and language fields fill the row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
